01:41:55.080 --> 01:41:58.940
the systems are designed with embedded fire protection. And we don't double

01:41:59.440 --> 01:42:03.100
or triple count fire protection flow rates. Once it's been designed and the reservoir capacity

01:42:03.600 --> 01:42:07.620
is there and the trunk systems are in place by simply adding on some

01:42:08.120 --> 01:42:11.860
additional fire protection. It really doesn't take any more water from the system. The system

01:42:12.360 --> 01:42:15.700
