01:42:16.200 --> 01:42:20.580
own hydraulic review for applications that are tendered, whether it be a Kitchener

01:42:21.080 --> 01:42:24.820
or Waterloo, as the case may be, in terms of subdivision extensions.

01:42:25.380 --> 01:42:29.510
