01:42:46.380 --> 01:42:49.580
So if you're extending, if you will, the fire flow capacity

01:42:49.820 --> 01:42:52.940
has been designed for the area and more of the same,

01:42:53.440 --> 01:42:56.420
there's no additional capacity or flows that would arise from that.

