02:07:34.870 --> 02:07:39.050
time. But yes, they just won't be net new capacity when they're

02:07:39.550 --> 02:07:42.609
back. Okay, I just feel like that we

02:07:43.109 --> 02:07:46.490
ran into this during the,

02:07:47.770 --> 02:07:51.450
what's the word I'm looking for, the budget process where we thought something

02:07:51.950 --> 02:07:55.280
wasn't included and then it was. So I just feel like we should be

02:07:55.780 --> 02:07:59.120
showing what we're currently sitting at, not what we could be sitting at.

02:07:59.280 --> 02:08:03.360
