processes from 2021 to 2026.

02:37:47.280 --> 02:37:48.880
Councillor Craig, would you like to speak to your motion?

02:37:51.120 --> 02:37:54.640
Well, thank you, Madam Chair. Yes, I would. And I've spent some time on this

02:37:55.140 --> 02:37:58.320
over the last couple of evenings. You know,

02:37:58.820 --> 02:38:02.160
I find it not fascinating. I don't know how to express it, but sitting here

02:38:02.660 --> 02:38:06.520
today, listening to all the discussion that is taking place about

02:38:07.020 --> 02:38:11.080
