03:05:03.190 --> 03:05:06.650
So the change in the wording is the

03:05:07.150 --> 03:05:10.650
region's water capacity reporting and communicating processes prior

03:05:14.620 --> 03:05:16.380
2026. Okay.

03:05:19.340 --> 03:05:21.020
Use your eScribe to vote.

03:05:26.380 --> 03:05:27.420
I'm in favor.

