Colleagues that is carried unanimously. That's great. So we're

03:05:40.080 --> 03:05:43.880
now back to the main motion, which as I will mind

03:05:44.380 --> 03:05:47.400
you, has been amended to 9 to 12 month period.

03:05:47.480 --> 03:05:50.000
And Councillor Erb, I think you were up next. Do you want to speak to

03:05:50.500 --> 03:05:53.080
the main motion? Yes, thank you.

03:05:53.960 --> 03:05:57.520
And I'm prepared to support it. And Councillor Craig will be happy because I

