03:14:09.180 --> 03:14:12.520
our water needs and reluctance for water permits and so on and so forth

03:14:13.020 --> 03:14:16.680
with the province. And passing this motion

03:14:17.000 --> 03:14:20.440
might actually be prickly for

03:14:20.940 --> 03:14:24.200
the province and cause them to put a moratorium on us.

03:14:24.530 --> 03:14:25.970
In the future, which we do not want.

03:14:27.970 --> 03:14:31.690
So through the chair to reiterate, we don't see every permit to take water application

03:14:32.190 --> 03:14:35.570
for comment. The only certain ones that we are

03:14:36.070 --> 03:14:39.810
asked to comment on, the ones that potentially could have impact on us.

03:14:40.850 --> 03:14:44.210
We have had conversations with the Ministry's Permit

03:14:44.710 --> 03:14:48.530
to Take Water Group and they have acknowledged that they're gonna

03:14:49.030 --> 03:14:53.040
