03:15:09.060 --> 03:15:12.120
happening and I wonder if it should remain a conversation rather than a motion,

03:15:12.620 --> 03:15:15.720
but I will reserve my judgment till voting time. Thanks.

03:15:16.360 --> 03:15:18.760
Councillor James. Thank you through you, Chair.

03:15:20.030 --> 03:15:23.430
I think Councillor Huinink sort of touched on my question. And Fiona, this I guess

03:15:23.930 --> 03:15:27.870
